BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 522.00 Td (The Foundation Certificate in Aviation and Maritime Skills is a one-year MQF Level 2 programme designed to) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 507.00 Td (provide learners with a broad introduction to the aviation and maritime sectors. The course combines practical,) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 492.00 Td (hands-on learning with essential theoretical knowledge to help students develop basic skills, safety awareness,) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 477.00 Td (and an understanding of industry practices within these fields. Throughout the programme, learners will explore) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 462.00 Td (key areas such as navigation, routine maintenance, safety procedures, teamwork, and professional conduct. The) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 447.00 Td (course also supports the development of key competences in communication, numeracy, digital literacy, and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 432.00 Td (personal development through a set of core key skills units. This programme is ideal for learners who have) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 417.00 Td (completed compulsory education and wish to gain foundational knowledge and skills before progressing to further) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 402.00 Td (vocational studies or entry-level roles within the aviation and maritime industries. It provides a solid) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 387.00 Td (platform for informed career choices while fostering responsibility, discipline, and awareness of real-world) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 372.00 Td (working environments.) Tj ET
BT 0.000 0.000 0.263 rg /F2 12.00 Tf 42.00 353.00 Td (Career Opportunities) Tj ET
