BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 538.00 Td (This programme of study provides the learner with an opportunity to get acquainted with the different vocational) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 523.00 Td (trades related to construction engineering. The vocational practice component is based on a 'taster' approach) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 508.00 Td (whereby the learner will learn about the tools, materials, processes and applications relative to: o Welding and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 493.00 Td (Fabrication o Plumbing and Electrical Installation o Refrigeration and Air-conditioning o Woodwork o Trowel) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (trades, including Restoration, Stone Masonry and Tile Laying. Technical Drawing will complement the five) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (vocational areas listed above. Learners will also have the opportunity to enhance their key skills, such as) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (English, Maltese, Mathematics, Science, Information Technology and Individual and Social Responsibility, all of) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 433.00 Td (which will be embedded in the vocational content.) Tj ET
