BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (for those learners intending to start and further their studies in Engineering. Key skills subjects also form an) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (integral part of this programme, giving learners the opportunity to nurture their competences in key areas:) Tj ET
