BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 538.00 Td (This programme of studies provides greater insight on advanced hairdressing techniques and better understanding) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 523.00 Td (of the requirements when working as a salon owner/manager. This course is aimed at learners who have obtained) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 508.00 Td (certification in the basic skills of hairdressing by completing the Level 3 Diploma in Hairdressing and want to) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 493.00 Td (proceed to more advanced techniques ranging from consulting to colouring, advanced cutting and styling. This) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (course equips learners with the knowledge and skills to provide a holistic hair service to clients. Learners are) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (given ample opportunity to practice through hands-on practical sessions and professional salon experience. As) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (part of the course, the learners are expected to practice hairdressing services within the inhouse salon at the) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 433.00 Td (Institute of Community Services. The course also equips learners with competences required to manage a) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 418.00 Td (professional hairdressing salon including knowledge in areas such as human resources management, legislative) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 403.00 Td (measures, basic accounting and marketing concepts. The MCAST Advanced Diploma in Hairdressing also covers men's) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 388.00 Td (haircutting and barbering. Alternatively, learners who complete successfully this two-year full-time course may) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 373.00 Td (wish to consider furthering their studies by progressing to a Bachleor in Vocational Education and Training 4.0.) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 358.00 Td (Which can lead to becoming a teacher in Vocational Education in secondary schools. Learners are required to) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 343.00 Td (purchase the necessary hairdressing accessories at the beginning of the academic year.) Tj ET
