BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 538.00 Td (This programme is an opportunity to develop an advanced understanding of the performing arts industry, its) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 523.00 Td (structures and practices. In the first year, learners will develop a fundamental understanding of the) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 508.00 Td (performance, design, technical, and management aspects of the industry. Training in these areas will enable) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 493.00 Td (learners to contextualise past and present practices in the performing arts. They will also engage with) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (well-being practices for a holistic preparation to more advanced learning and work in a complex industry.) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (Following the successful progression from their first year, students have the opportunity to advance their) Tj ET
