BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 433.00 Td (also develop entrepreneurial skills, and be given a work-based learning opportunity within a related private or) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 418.00 Td (public entity. They will also learn basic skills for performing in front of a camera. Ultimately, learners will) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 403.00 Td (be able to apply all their skills in the production and presentation of a performance. At the end of this) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 388.00 Td (course, learners will be geared to pursue a variety of work opportunities in the industry, or to further their) Tj ET
