BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 538.00 Td (Communicating messages successfully via graphic design requires a high level of understanding of the visual art) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 523.00 Td (of representation. This highly contextualised programme draws on contemporary design practice, together with) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 508.00 Td (theoretical and historical cultural material. The degree will equip learners with the knowledge to explore and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 493.00 Td (challenge creative boundaries, through real-life design scenarios. They will hone their skills in fundamental) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (design principles such as layout, form, typography, iconography and colour. Learners will analyse a wide range) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (of professional design problems, and find creative and innovative solutions using various media. The main aim of) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (this degree programme is to focus on design as a means for communicating meaningful messages, gathering content,) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 433.00 Td (organising information, creating and presenting narratives and experiences, while always looking ahead to affect) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 418.00 Td (change.) Tj ET
