BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 522.00 Td (This Mechanical Engineering degree programme provides the learners with a solid understanding of relevant) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 507.00 Td (engineering fundamentals and prepares them for a broad range of career options in the manufacturing field. This) Tj ET
