BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 477.00 Td (develop in learners a firm understanding of principles and disciplines which are needed in the modelling,) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 462.00 Td (measuring, analysis and design of mechanical components and systems. On completing the course, graduates will be) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 447.00 Td (expected to demonstrate that they have assimilated the professional skills necessary for formulating and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 432.00 Td (executing engineering projects. The course also provides training in teamwork and effective communication) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 417.00 Td (skills. This course is recognised by the Board tal-Inginiera as a prerequisite for the application of the) Tj ET
