BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 522.00 Td (The protection of natural resources, CO2 emissions, climate change and its effects, and demographic changes, are) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 507.00 Td (increasingly important topics in the local and international context. The programme merges classical engineering) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 492.00 Td (with natural sciences. Environmental Engineering Sciences and Sustainable Technologies deal with engineering) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 477.00 Td (solutions for environmentally relevant challenges of our future. This course provides learners with the ability) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 462.00 Td (to use problem-solving approaches for dealing with ecological and technical challenges, in order to creatively) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 447.00 Td (arrive at a situation of resource sustainability. The course is a technically-oriented programme that offers) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 432.00 Td (learners a broad range of fields of application. Graduates can be active in the planning, construction and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 417.00 Td (operation of environmental technological facilities, in research and teaching, environmental organisations,) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 402.00 Td (administration, and consultancy businesses of their own.) Tj ET
