BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (industry. Students leave the BA hons with the skills and knowledge needed to enter the industry. This Master's) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (course aims to provide students with the opportunity to explore the creative process in a more holistic way, by) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (broadening their conceptual framework and extending their operational field within an interdisciplinary) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 433.00 Td (dimension. The Master's aims to help students build themselves as individual artists, while giving them the) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 418.00 Td (tools to make an impact within the ever-changing commercial and academic landscape by becoming more versatile) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 403.00 Td (thinkers. The Master's focuses on five main areas: the creative process, social community, commercial and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 388.00 Td (culture. Self Development: Most students graduating with a B.A.\(Hons\) are still in the process of discovering) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 373.00 Td (who they are as individuals, artists, citizens, and members of a community and therefore unable to really) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 358.00 Td (communicate this. They might have acquired the skills, tools, and techniques to create visual work, but not the) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 343.00 Td (self-awareness to know what they want to communicate, or the ability to communicate that through their chosen) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 328.00 Td (art form. The Master's course aims to provide students with the avenue and opportunity to discover this. With) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 313.00 Td (the input of individuals from outside the artistic sphere \(Lecturers in Philosophy, Cultural Theory, Semiotics,) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 298.00 Td (Sociology etc\), students are guided through projects within which they will be encouraged to discover who they) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 283.00 Td (are, the multiple identities they inhabit, their values, their stories, what they want to say, and to) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 268.00 Td (communicate this through design. The Creative Process: The creative process is different for every artist) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 253.00 Td (although there are methods and research tools which open avenues of thinking and developing ideas which benefit) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 238.00 Td (everyone. Unfortunately, the terms 'Research', and 'Practice' are often seen as separate activities. This) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 223.00 Td (Master's will instil a research and practice attitude in students that will benefit whatever project they will) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 208.00 Td (face. This process, while often individualistic, should also be one of communication, sharing, and teamwork. The) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 193.00 Td (course was designed in a way to enhance a Community of Practitioners. Social/Community: MCAST aims to be a) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 178.00 Td ("College for the Community", keeping in contact with the world outside the college walls. Students are required) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 163.00 Td (to seek out and communicate with entities from outside the college, specifically NGOs, charities, local) Tj ET
