BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 538.00 Td (The Award in Vocational and Employability Skills \(Introductory Level A\) is a structured programme of study that) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 523.00 Td (helps students with learning disabilities / learning difficulties acquire skills necessary to gain and maintain) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 508.00 Td (employment or to further their education. Students will be trained in Hospitality and Retail, and Office Skills.) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 493.00 Td (They are also assessed in Key skills which include Maltese, English, Mathematics, IT, PSHE, Daily Living and) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (Community Skills and Customer Care and Employability skills. A work placement experience within the college is) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (also provided. Before enrolling in the programme, students are required to attend a three-day evaluation period) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (to assess their suitability for the course.) Tj ET
BT 0.000 0.000 0.263 rg /F2 12.00 Tf 42.00 429.00 Td (Career Opportunities) Tj ET
0.843 0.675 0.275 RG 1 w 42.00 422.00 m 553.00 422.00 l S
