BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 366.00 Td (Finished Compulsory Education. Provision of documents including School Leaving Certificate. A recent) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 351.00 Td (psychological report \(issued no more than 3 years before the date of application\) and school reports including) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 336.00 Td (the last Individual Education Plan \(IEP\). Adapt to both class-based and community-based learning - to be) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 321.00 Td (ascertained through an induction session at MCAST, attendance for which is compulsory.) Tj ET
