BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 538.00 Td (This course is a continuation in the career of a Deck Officer in the merchant shipping navy leading to the issue) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 523.00 Td (of a Certificate of Competence as a Chief Mate. The training provided is at management level and learners) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 508.00 Td (attending this course are expected to dedicate a lot of time to their studies and to wear a merchant marine) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 493.00 Td (uniform whilst undergoing training ashore. The Centre for Maritime studies boasts a good reputation for) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 478.00 Td (discipline and all Officers are expected to abide by a Code of Conduct whilst attending the Chief Mate Course) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 463.00 Td (and to actively participate in organised events. Practical STCW ancillary courses, namely medical care and radar) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 448.00 Td (navigation including simulation exercises, are also provided as compulsory short courses for the Chief Mate) Tj ET
BT 0.070 0.086 0.180 rg /F1 9.50 Tf 42.00 433.00 Td (Certificate of Competency) Tj ET
